{"rpid": "3507018", "root": "0", "parent": "0", "uname": "zzyamsterdam", "mid": "382056", "level": 1, "vip": 0, "content": "In this brand new timelapse FyreUK build a mystical city of Mages.\n\nWe build a large majestic city that mixes the idea of magical summoning and epic buildings into one interesting build; featuring everything from large scale buildings to small floating lanterns.\n\nInspired by classic fantasy fiction, we build a huge city with a grand central City of Mages with Airships and Boats docking outside the city.\nWe were inspired by the followering:\nThe Elder Scrolls : http://bit.ly/JGhElA\nBlock Fortress (Awesome Minecraft Builder): http://www.youtube.com/watch?v=rKyIp5HM648\nLord of the Rings: http://cache.io9.com/assets/images/8/2010/04/minastirith.jpg\nVarious other works of Fantasy Fiction. (Wizards and Mages)\n\n♥ Enjoy and remember to comment, rate and Subscibe! ♥\n\n◆Texture pack:\nCustomized version of Dokucraft: http://www.minecraftforum.net/topic/513093-11-dokucraft-the-saga-continues-32x/", "like": 1, "ctime": 1338195026, "rcount": 0, "ip": "", "images": [], "video_aid": "275413", "video_bvid": "BV1ux411F7rC", "video_title": "【FyreUK】Minecraft Timelapse - Laenadur City of Mages", "video_desc": "Minecraft Timelapse - Laenadur _ City of Mages 作者：fyreUK 原帖地址：http://www.youtube.com/watch?v=VCCCD1jMP0o", "video_owner": "zzyamsterdam", "video_view": 3180, "video_reply": 14, "video_n1": 14, "video_n2": 0}
